        "specialInstructions": "Check In: 20 minutes prior to departure time\n\nLocation: Check in and board at 237 Stearns Wharf (wood pier at the end of State Street). We are 3/4 of the way down the wharf on the left side across from Moby Dick restaurant. Look for the blue and white flag that reads 'BOAT RIDES'. We accept credit & debit cards only, no cash.\n"
