    "timeZone": "America/Los_Angeles",
    "description": "Join us for the ultimate Santa Barbara Happy Hour experience! Departing from the historic Stearns Wharf, our 70\u2019 luxury yacht, Azure Seas, invites you to revel in 90 minutes of sea breezes, sunshine, and coastal-inspired drinks along our sun-kissed coastline. Relax in comfort with indoor booths or soak up the sun on the deck, for a unique Happy Hour moment. Gaze over the American Riviera coastline, from the sun-drenched beaches to the peaks of the Santa Ynez mountains, as you select from local beer, wine, or our signature cocktails.",
